 "user_questions": [
  {
   "seq": 37,
   "question": "Two choices change the components in this spec. (1) Where should the 'last order date' come from? Orders are not in Salesforce (Order has 0 records; OrderPickerController says they live in the external Pronto Orders API). Options: (a) a new Contact.Last_Order_Date__c written by the Pronto app integration, like Lifetime_Orders__c [recommended]; (b) a roll-up of Loyalty_Transaction__c records with source 'Order'; (c) a scheduled Apex callout to Pronto_Orders_API. (2) How should the segment reach the win-back campaign? Options: (a) a Contact report whose results are added to a Salesforce Campaign [recommended: Campaign records exist, no Data 360 streams]; (b) a Data 360 segment activated to Marketing Cloud; (c) a Contact list view only.",
   "simulated_answer": "(1) No preference; use your recommended default. (2) Activate the segment to Marketing Cloud."
  }
